        heading: 'Short title, extent and commencement',
        text: '(1) This Act may be called the Uttar Pradesh Regulation of Money-Lending Act, 1976. (2) It extends to the whole of Uttar Pradesh. (3) It shall come into force on such date as the State Government may, by notification, appoint in this behalf. [Note: this is the Authoritative English Text of the Uttar Pradesh Sahukari Viniyaman Adhiniyam, 1976.]',
